# init.nx737j.rc — nubia Z70S Ultra (NX737J)
#
# Intentionally inert. The stock vendor ramdisk brings up ALL hardware; this
# file exists only as a hook for later device-specific tweaks.
#
# Do NOT put `setprop ro.*` here — ro properties are fixed at build time and
# the write silently fails. Put them in system.prop instead.
# Do NOT redefine any service the stock vendor already declares — that is a
# guaranteed boot hang.

on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    # placeholder for post-boot device tweaks
